+# Polyline width source fixture
+
+Hand-authored AC1032 ASCII DXF created for this width patch under MPL-2.0.
+No external drawing or proprietary input was copied. Four XY vertices retain
+header defaults .2/.4 and independent overrides: {}, {start:0}, {end:0},
+{start:.2,end:.4}. The last record is dormant while open. Expected tag presence
+is literal, independent of the codec writer. Binary output is inspected by an
+independent group-code oracle in polyline_width_exchange.rs.
